  <body>
    <div>
      <p begin="00:00:00.000" end="00:00:01.000">A night nurse covers for a colleague.</p>
      <p begin="00:00:01.000" end="00:00:02.500">The hospital is hiding a death.<br/>She calls the police.</p>
    </div>
  </body>
